type: software
title: "ChemML Mini-Lab: Runnable Experiments in Physics-Informed ML & AI for Materials Discovery"
abstract: "Compact, reproducible PyTorch and cheminformatics experiments illustrating out-of-distribution extrapolation, physical symmetries, equivariance, and data-efficient machine learning for chemistry and materials science."
